					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403741#post-1289228</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403741/run-away-forevurrr#post-1289228</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 24 Oct 2011 18:26:52 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Gears</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>172464</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I like this a lot, actually. It's sometimes easy to forget that some of these things have very human wants and needs. yes, it sucks to be a &quot;ward&quot; of The Foundation&#8230;but you're also provided for, not (generally) shot at, and not stared at over-much.</p> <p>I might have to try something like this, where a SCP finally escapes&#8230;only to remember that the outside world really kinda sucks.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
